<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Step & Snack - Scroll Animation</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Matter.js -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/matter-js/0.19.0/matter.min.js"></script>
  <!-- GSAP & ScrollTrigger -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
</head>

<body>
  <div id="loader">
    <div class="loader__label">Loading ... <span id="loaderPct">0</span>%</div>
    <div class="loader__bar-bg">
      <div id="loaderBar"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Header Navigation -->
  <header id="main-header">
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="logo-icon">🌱</span>
      <div class="logo-text">
        <strong>BIME</strong>
        <span>BioMechatronics Engineering</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="top-nav">
      <a href="https://www.bime.ntu.edu.tw/Default.html" target="_blank">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="#">ACADEMICS</a>
      <a href="#">RESEARCH</a>
      <a href="#">ADMISSION</a>
      <a href="#">NEWS</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="menu-icon">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Vertical Navigation Bar -->
  <nav id="vertical-nav">
    <div class="nav-track"></div>
    <a href="#core-elements" class="nav-item active">
      <div class="nav-indicator"></div>
      <div class="nav-text">
        <span class="nav-num">01</span>
        <span class="nav-label">生物</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="#six-fields" class="nav-item">
      <div class="nav-indicator"></div>
      <div class="nav-text">
        <span class="nav-num">02</span>
        <span class="nav-label">六大領域</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="#azalea-works" class="nav-item">
      <div class="nav-indicator"></div>
      <div class="nav-text">
        <span class="nav-num">03</span>
        <span class="nav-label">杜鵑花節作品</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <main id="page" class="is-hidden">

    <!-- Section 1: Core Elements (DNA scroll animation) -->
    <section id="core-elements" class="scroll-container">
      <div class="canvas-wrapper">
        <canvas id="bg-canvas"></canvas>
        <canvas id="animation-canvas"></canvas>
        <!-- High-res textless background for the initial frame -->
        <img id="landing-static-bg" src="landing-bg.jpg" alt="">
      </div>

      <!-- Initial Landing Overlay (Frame 0) -->
      <div class="ppt-overlay visible" id="overlay-landing">
        <div class="landing-left">
          <h1 class="landing-title">
            Engineering<br>Life.<br>
            <span class="highlight">Designing<br>the Future.</span>
          </h1>
          <hr class="overlay-divider">
          <p class="landing-desc">
            結合生物科學與機電工程，<br>
            從生命系統出發，創造更智慧、更永續的未來。
          </p>
          <div class="landing-actions">
            <button class="watch-btn"><span class="icon">▶</span> WATCH INTRO</button>
            <span class="scroll-hint">SCROLL TO EXPLORE ⟶</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="landing-right">
          <p>DNA is the<br>language of life.<br>We engineer<br>its possibilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text overlays tied to scroll progress -->
      <div class="ppt-overlay" id="overlay-bio">
        <div class="overlay-left">
          <h1 class="overlay-num">01</h1>
          <h2 class="overlay-title-zh">生物</h2>
          <h3 class="overlay-title-en">BIOLOGY</h3>
          <hr class="overlay-divider">
          <p class="overlay-desc">
            探索生命的本質，<br>
            從基因、細胞到生態系統，<br>
            我們理解生命如何運作，<br>
            並以生物科技創造價值。
          </p>
          <button class="explore-btn">
            <span class="icon">🍃</span> EXPLORE &rarr;
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-bottom-right">
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">🧬</div>
            <h4>基礎生物科學</h4>
            <p>分子生物學、<br>細胞生物學、遺傳學</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">🌿</div>
            <h4>生物技術應用</h4>
            <p>基因工程、發酵技術、<br>生物材料開發</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">🌍</div>
            <h4>生態與永續</h4>
            <p>生態研究、永續發展、<br>環境與生物多樣性</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ppt-overlay" id="overlay-mechanics">
        <div class="overlay-center-right">
          <h1 class="overlay-num">02</h1>
          <h2 class="overlay-title-zh">機械</h2>
          <h3 class="overlay-title-en">MECHANICS</h3>
          <hr class="overlay-divider">
          <p class="overlay-desc">
            結合力學原理與精密設計，<br>
            推動系統整合與自動化技術，<br>
            讓生物科技從實驗走向應用，<br>
            實現更高效能與可靠度。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-bottom-right">
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">⚙️</div>
            <h4>機構設計與分析</h4>
            <p>力學建模、結構分析、<br>機構設計與優化</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">🦾</div>
            <h4>自動化與控制</h4>
            <p>控制系統、感測整合、<br>自動化製程開發</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">📦</div>
            <h4>系統整合與應用</h4>
            <p>跨域整合、系統模組化、<br>工程實作與驗證</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ppt-overlay" id="overlay-electricity">
        <div class="overlay-center-right">
          <h1 class="overlay-num">03</h1>
          <h2 class="overlay-title-zh">電子</h2>
          <h3 class="overlay-title-en">ELECTRONICS</h3>
          <hr class="overlay-divider">
          <p class="overlay-desc">
            將生物訊號轉化為電子數據，<br>
            結合感測、訊號處理與嵌入式系統，<br>
            推動智慧裝置與精準監測應用，<br>
            開創生物科技與電子技術的整合未來。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="overlay-bottom-right">
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">🖧</div>
            <h4>感測與訊號處理</h4>
            <p>生物感測、訊號擷取、<br>類比數位轉換</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">⚡</div>
            <h4>嵌入式系統開發</h4>
            <p>嵌入式設計、韌體開發、<br>即時運算處理</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sub-field">
            <div class="icon-circle">📡</div>
            <h4>通訊與物聯整合</h4>
            <p>無線通訊、資料傳輸、<br>物聯網平台整合</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- This spacer dictates how much we can scroll to drive the DNA animation -->
      <div class="scroll-spacer"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2: Six Major Fields (Hub and Spoke UI) -->
    <section id="six-fields" class="hub-spoke-section">

      <!-- Left Column: Intro -->
      <div class="hub-intro">
        <span class="hub-number">02</span>
        <h2 class="hub-title">六大研究領域</h2>
        <p class="hub-subtitle">SIX RESEARCH AREAS</p>
        <div class="hub-divider"></div>
        <p class="hub-desc">六大專業領域並進發展，<br>共同推動跨域整合與技術創新，<br>解決真實世界的挑戰。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: The Wheel -->
      <div class="hub-wheel-container">
        <div class="wheel-ring outer"></div>
        <div class="wheel-ring main"></div>
        <div class="wheel-ring inner"></div>
        <div class="wheel-ring core"></div>

        <!-- Central Hub -->
        <div class="wheel-center">
          <h2>BIME</h2>
          <p>BioMechatronics<br>Engineering</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 6 Field Nodes -->

        <!-- 1. Top -->
        <div class="field-node node-top" data-layout="one-third"
          data-img="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586771107445-d3ca888129ff?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          data-desc="運用先端科技結合自然環境，打造永續發展的智慧農業生態系，並透過物聯網即時監控生長數據。">
          <div class="field-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z" />
              <path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="node-label label-top">
            <h3>智慧農業</h3>
            <p>Smart Agriculture</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Top Right -->
        <div class="field-node node-tr" data-layout="one-third"
          data-img="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532187863486-abf9db097987?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          data-desc="透過先進的生物感測技術，精準捕捉微小的生物訊號，廣泛應用於醫療檢測與環境監測。">
          <div class="field-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="node-label label-right">
            <h3>生物感測</h3>
            <p>Biosensing</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Bottom Right -->
        <div class="field-node node-br"
          data-img="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1485827404703-89b55fcc595e?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          data-desc="整合自動化控制與機器人技術，提升生產效率並降低人力負擔，開創未來的智慧工廠。">
          <div class="field-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2" />
              <rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6" />
              <line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4" />
              <line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4" />
              <line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23" />
              <line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23" />
              <line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9" />
              <line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14" />
              <line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9" />
              <line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="node-label label-right">
            <h3>機器人與自動化</h3>
            <p>Robotics & Automation</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Bottom -->
        <div class="field-node node-bottom" data-layout="one-third"
          data-img="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          data-desc="利用人工智慧演算法解析龐大的生物數據，從基因解碼到疾病預測，探索生命的未知領域。">
          <div class="field-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3" />
              <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3" />
              <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3" />
              <line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49" />
              <line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="node-label label-bottom">
            <h3>人工智慧與生物資訊</h3>
            <p>AI & Bioinformatics</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Bottom Left -->
        <div class="field-node node-bl"
          data-img="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565439387600-4e2b0cc7f45c?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          data-desc="將極致工藝與現代科技結合，實現微米級別的精密製造，為生醫器材與尖端科技奠定基礎。">
          <div class="field-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
              <path
                d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="node-label label-left">
            <h3>精密製造</h3>
            <p>Advanced Manufacturing</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Top Left -->
        <div class="field-node node-tl"
          data-img="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466611653911-95081537e5b7?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
          data-desc="致力於尋找替代能源與循環經濟的解方，結合生質能技術，保護我們賴以生存的地球環境。">
          <div class="field-icon">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" />
              <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="node-label label-left">
            <h3>生質能源與環境</h3>
            <p>Bioenergy & Environment</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Azalea Festival Works (Sticky horizontal scroll) -->
    <section id="azalea-works">
      <div class="sticky-container">
        <h2 class="section-title azalea-title">杜鵑花節作品展</h2>
        <div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper">
          <div class="work-card">作品一</div>
          <div class="work-card">作品二</div>
          <div class="work-card">作品三</div>
          <div class="work-card">作品四</div>
          <div class="work-card">作品五</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Six Fields Modal (16:9 Layout) -->
    <div id="field-modal" class="modal-hidden">
      <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
      <div class="modal-content sixteen-nine">
        <button class="modal-close-btn">
          <span></span>
          <span></span>
        </button>

        <div class="modal-split-layout">
          <!-- Text Area (Whitespace & Introduction) -->
          <div class="modal-text-area">
            <div class="modal-header">
              <div class="modal-icon" id="modal-icon">🌱</div>
              <h2 id="modal-title">智慧農業</h2>
              <p id="modal-subtitle">Smart Agriculture</p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
              <p>這裡將展示該領域的詳細介紹與核心技術。未來可替換為真實的文案與數據。</p>
              <p>運用先端科技結合自然環境，打造永續發展的農業生態系。</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Photo & Mask Area -->
          <div class="modal-photo-area">
            <!-- Placeholder image, can be updated dynamically via JS later -->
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586771107445-d3ca888129ff?q=80&w=2072&auto=format&fit=crop"
              alt="Field Photo" id="modal-image">
            <div class="modal-photo-mask"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <!-- Floating Status Widget -->
  <div id="status-widget">
    <div class="status-item">
      <span class="status-icon">📍</span>
      <span class="status-label">目前進度</span>
      <strong id="current-section-text">生物</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="status-divider"></div>
    <div class="status-item">
      <span class="status-icon">👁️</span>
      <span class="status-label">瀏覽人數</span>
      <strong id="visitor-count-text">載入中...</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="script.js?v=2"></script>
</body>

</html>